      "path": "styles.css",
      "content": ":root {\n  --bg: #1b1f2a;\n  --card: #262c3a;\n  --key: #333b4d;\n  --key-hover: #3f4a61;\n  --accent: #5aa9e6;\n  --text: #eef2f8;\n  --muted: #9aa7bd;\n  --good: #4cd08a;\n  --bad: #e6666b;\n}\n\n* { box-sizing: border-box; }\n\n[hidden] { display: none !important; }\n\nhtml, body {\n  margin: 0;\n  min-height: 100vh;\n}\n\nbody {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n  padding: 24px 16px;\n  background: radial-gradient(circle at 50% 0%, #2a3345 0%, var(--bg) 60%);\n  color: var(--text);\n  font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, sans-serif;\n  font-size: 16px;\n}\n\n.card {\n  width: 100%;\n  max-width: 380px;\n  background: var(--card);\n  border-radius: 20px;\n  padding: 28px 24px 24px;\n  box-shadow: 0 20px 50px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.45);\n  text-align: center;\n}\n\nh1 {\n  margin: 0 0 6px;\n  font-size: 1.5rem;\n  letter-spacing: 0.02em;\n}\n\n.hint {\n  margin: 0 0 18px;\n  color: var(--muted);\n  font-size: 1rem;\n}\n\n.display {\n  background: #161a23;\n  border-radius: 14px;\n  padding: 16px 12px;\n  margin-bottom: 20px;\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  gap: 6px;\n  align-items: center;\n}\n\n.dots {\n  font-size: 2rem;\n  letter-spacing: 0.5em;\n  margin-right: -0.5em;\n  color: var(--accent);\n  min-height: 2.4rem;\n}\n\n.status {\n  font-size: 1.05rem;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  color: var(--muted);\n}\n\n.status.good { color: var(--good); }\n.status.bad { color: var(--bad); }\n\n.keypad {\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);\n  gap: 12px;\n}\n\n.key {\n  font-family: inherit;\n  font-size: 1.35rem;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  color: var(--text);\n  background: var(--key);\n  border: 2px solid transparent;\n  border-radius: 14px;\n  padding: 16px 8px;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  transition: background 0.15s, transform 0.05s, border-color 0.15s;\n}\n\n.key:hover { background: var(--key-hover); }\n\n.key:focus-visible {\n  outline: none;\n  border-color: var(--accent);\n  background: var(--key-hover);\n}\n\n.key:active { transform: scale(0.96); }\n\n.key:disabled {\n  opacity: 0.45;\n  cursor: not-allowed;\n}\n\n.key-clear {\n  font-size: 1rem;\n  color: var(--bad);\n  background: #3a2b30;\n}\n\n.key-clear:hover { background: #47343a; }\n\n.key-enter {\n  font-size: 1rem;\n  color: #0f1a12;\n  background: var(--good);\n}\n\n.key-enter:hover { background: #5de19b; }\n\n.tries {\n  margin: 18px 0 0;\n  color: var(--muted);\n  font-size: 0.95rem;\n}\n",
      "description": "Theme and control states with responsive layout."
    },
    {
      "path": "script.js",
      "content": "const CODE = \"4271\";\nconst MAX_TRIES = 3;\nconst LOCK_MS = 10000;\n\nconst dotsEl = document.getElementById(\"dots\");\nconst statusEl = document.getElementById(\"status\");\nconst triesEl = document.getElementById(\"tries\");\nconst keypadEl = document.getElementById(\"keypad\");\nconst clearBtn = document.getElementById(\"clearBtn\");\nconst enterBtn = document.getElementById(\"enterBtn\");\n\nlet entry = \"\";\nlet wrongTries = 0;\nlet locked = false;\nlet unlockTimer = null;\n\nfunction setStatus(text, cls) {\n  statusEl.textContent = text;\n  statusEl.className = \"status\" + (cls ? \" \" + cls : \"\");\n}\n\nfunction renderDots() {\n  const filled = \"•\".repeat(entry.length);\n  const empty = \"·\".repeat(4 - entry.length);\n  dotsEl.textContent = filled + empty;\n}\n\nfunction renderTries() {\n  const left = Math.max(0, MAX_TRIES - wrongTries);\n  triesEl.textContent = \"Attempts left: \" + left;\n}\n\nfunction updateControls() {\n  keypadEl.querySelectorAll(\"button\").forEach((b) => {\n    b.disabled = locked;\n  });\n}\n\nfunction lock() {\n  locked = true;\n  entry = \"\";\n  renderDots();\n  updateControls();\n  let seconds = LOCK_MS / 1000;\n  setStatus(\"Locked for \" + seconds + \"s\", \"bad\");\n  unlockTimer = setInterval(() => {\n    seconds -= 1;\n    if (seconds <= 0) {\n      clearInterval(unlockTimer);\n      unlockTimer = null;\n      locked = false;\n      wrongTries = 0;\n      renderTries();\n      updateControls();\n      setStatus(\"Locked\", \"\");\n    } else {\n      setStatus(\"Locked for \" + seconds + \"s\", \"bad\");\n    }\n  }, 1000);\n}\n\nfunction submit() {\n  if (locked) return;\n  if (entry.length < 4) {\n    setStatus(\"Enter 4 digits\", \"bad\");\n    return;\n  }\n  if (entry === CODE) {\n    setStatus(\"Unlocked\", \"good\");\n    entry = \"\";\n    renderDots();\n    wrongTries = 0;\n    renderTries();\n  } else {\n    wrongTries += 1;\n    entry = \"\";\n    renderDots();\n    renderTries();\n    if (wrongTries >= MAX_TRIES) {\n      lock();\n    } else {\n      setStatus(\"Wrong code\", \"bad\");\n    }\n  }\n}\n\nfunction addDigit(d) {\n  if (locked) return;\n  if (entry.length >= 4) return;\n  entry += d;\n  renderDots();\n  setStatus(\"Entering…\", \"\");\n}\n\nfunction clearEntry() {\n  if (locked) return;\n  entry = \"\";\n  renderDots();\n  setStatus(\"Locked\", \"\");\n}\n\nkeypadEl.addEventListener(\"click\", (e) => {\n  const btn = e.target.closest(\"button\");\n  if (!btn || btn.disabled) return;\n  const digit = btn.getAttribute(\"data-digit\");\n  if (digit !== null) {\n    addDigit(digit);\n  } else if (btn === clearBtn) {\n    clearEntry();\n  } else if (btn === enterBtn) {\n    submit();\n  }\n});\n\ndocument.addEventListener(\"keydown\", (e) => {\n  if (locked) return;\n  if (/^[0-9]$/.test(e.key)) {\n    addDigit(e.key);\n  } else if (e.key === \"Backspace\") {\n    e.preventDefault();\n    entry = entry.slice(0, -1);\n    renderDots();\n  } else if (e.key === \"Enter\") {\n    submit();\n  } else if (e.key === \"Escape\") {\n    clearEntry();\n  }\n});\n\nrenderDots();\nrenderTries();\nsetStatus(\"Locked\", \"\");\n",
      "description": "Lock logic with entry, validation, lockout timer, and keyboard support."
    },
    {
      "path": "README.md",
      "content": "# Keypad Lock\n\nA pixel-style keypad lock built with plain HTML, CSS, and JavaScript. Works fully offline in any modern browser.\n\n## Features\n\n- Enter a 4-digit code using the on-screen keypad or your keyboard.\n- Correct code `4271` shows **Unlocked**.\n- Wrong code shows **Wrong code**.\n- After 3 wrong attempts the keypad locks for 10 seconds.\n- Clear button resets the current entry; Enter submits it.\n- Keyboard support: digits to type, Backspace to delete, Enter to submit, Escape to clear.\n\n## Usage\n\nOpen `index.html` in a browser. No build step or server required.\n\n## Files\n\n- `index.html` — markup and layout\n- `styles.css` — theme and control states\n- `script.js` — lock logic\n",
      "description": "Project documentation and usage instructions."
    }
  ]
}